# curl-packages
# One installer per line. Each script is piped to bash during install.
# Format: <url> [args...]
# Any args after the URL are passed to the installer (via `bash -s --`).

# fff MCP server (fast file search for AI agents + neovim)
https://dmtrkovalenko.dev/install-fff-mcp.sh

# planning + code review tool for opencode
#
# --skip-skills: the plannotator-* skills are maintained in the skills
# submodule (home/.config/agents/skills), so the installer must not write its
# own copies. Left unsuppressed it writes into every agent scope it knows —
# including ~/.agents/skills, which symlinks back into this repo, so its output
# lands in the working tree. The same flag also suppresses the extras step,
# which shells out to `npx skills add`.
https://plannotator.ai/install.sh --skip-skills
